I’ll inspect the project structure, then add Angular-specific ignore rules to `.gitignore`.

Add this to `.gitignore`:

````gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Angular build output
dist/
.angular/
.angular/cache/

# Test coverage
coverage/

# Environment files
.env
.env.*

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# IDE files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
